What:		/sys/kernel/debug/mt6580_sysirq
Date:		October 2026
Contact:	FuQuan <i@fuquan.moe>
Description:
		Read-only cached MT6580 SYSIRQ polarity PM snapshots. saved values
		are captured in syscore suspend after device IRQ setup; resume values
		are captured before restoring changed polarity words. restored values
		are read back after restoration, before global IRQ enable. No MMIO
		reads are performed by the debugfs attribute. prepared indicates a
		pending restore, saves/restores count completed callbacks, lost_words
		counts changed words observed on resume and errors counts failed
		restoration checks. Each polarity[n] lists saved/resume/restored.
		Only MT6580 enables these callbacks; other SYSIRQ SoCs are unchanged.
		Matching values with lost_words=0 qualify retention and PM ordering,
		not actual recovery after infra power loss.
